        <h1><a href="/">The Baseball Chronicle</a></h1>
        <h2><span class="entryprev"><a href="http://thebaseballchronicle.com/reporting/the_once_and_future_baseball_man" title="Previous story">&#8592;</a></span> <a href="http://thebaseballchronicle.com/personal_stories/">Personal stories</a>, August 2010 <span class="entrynext"><a href="http://thebaseballchronicle.com/fiction/the_man_on_the_mound" title="Next story">&#8594;</a></span</h2>
